      "writtenOn": "2026-04-20T19:23:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, thanks for checking it especially on non-chromebook device. Yeah, for me, when I was testing this patch originally, I\u0027ve checked on ADL and PTL: the keyboard reset work just fine, so I\u0027ve implemented it as below. But I agree that we could change the order and start with PCI warm reset - will change it as suggested. As for the fallback as it is already implemented and it is namely several lines of code (counting pkvm_delay), I think it is worth keeping it.\n\nI am not sure if we need ACPI based reboot - will go back to it as I just notice your last comment - keeping it open and will respond soon.",
      "parentUuid": "95fdd935_62d28d2d",
      "revId": "3593eba18ffcc3018c161fe5ae6fe673b552d335",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
