      "message": "Is this to kick the host vCPU out of VMX non-root mode? If so, we need to use send INIT rather than NMI, as if the host vCPU is running in VMX non-root mode, it can directly receive the NMI and handle it rather than vmexit to the pKVM hypervisor.",
